WEBVTT

00:05.710 --> 00:07.470
No... Why?

00:08.660 --> 00:11.970
Is it because of that box Abiko-sempai had?

00:13.290 --> 00:14.640
What should I do?

00:15.290 --> 00:18.030
I know... I’ll ask Masaki-san!

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

01:50.930 --> 01:52.690
Takasu Ayako’s signal is gone.

01:52.690 --> 01:53.600
Rescan.

01:53.600 --> 01:54.600
Confirming.

01:54.600 --> 01:55.520
Signal, 0.

01:55.520 --> 01:56.680
She’s totally gone.

01:56.680 --> 01:57.740
Turn down the squelch.

01:57.740 --> 01:59.600
Heavy noise. Cannot detect target.

01:59.600 --> 02:00.990
Any message from East-B?

02:00.990 --> 02:02.370
Not as of yet.

02:02.370 --> 02:04.350
Contacting America, as well.

02:04.350 --> 02:06.480
Ayako’s beatrice signal is gone?

02:11.190 --> 02:13.030
Ayako-san!

02:13.030 --> 02:16.530
To heal your wounded heart,
I, Abiko Tsuneo,

02:16.530 --> 02:19.530
will, with my whole body and soul...

02:20.870 --> 02:24.220
announce that it’s five o’clock!

02:25.640 --> 02:29.670
Great, considering he’s the one who sealed her power.

02:29.670 --> 02:32.670
I guess that wasn’t enough punishment.

02:33.280 --> 02:35.870
Some weird-colored liquid’s coming out of his ears.

02:35.870 --> 02:36.870
Creepy, but cute!

02:38.120 --> 02:42.660
Don’t Leave Me

02:43.970 --> 02:47.440
So the Silver Maria made her move.

02:47.440 --> 02:50.030
I thought she would strike quickly, but...

02:51.130 --> 02:52.520
A Horacle...

02:52.520 --> 02:54.320
This is a problem.

02:54.320 --> 02:55.730
We need to hurry.

02:55.730 --> 02:57.070
What’s going to happen?

02:57.070 --> 03:01.080
Ayako, you’re not simply a beatrice user.

03:01.080 --> 03:04.380
You were chosen by the beatrice.
Your talent is incredible and rare.

03:04.380 --> 03:08.680
The beatrice runs through you,
down to your last strand of hair.

03:08.680 --> 03:11.240
It’s a part of you now, just like your flesh and blood.

03:11.240 --> 03:16.710
To you, being unable to use beatrice is the same as being unable to breathe.

03:17.530 --> 03:20.900
We must undo the seal, or your body will weaken,

03:20.900 --> 03:23.740
and you’ll lose the ability to control beatrice.

03:24.420 --> 03:25.430
Forever.

03:25.430 --> 03:26.700
Forever?

03:28.310 --> 03:30.480
The time limit is one week.

03:31.770 --> 03:33.270
Ayako-san...

03:33.270 --> 03:37.710
Well, if you come to my lab in Germany,
I can do something about it.

03:38.340 --> 03:39.750
Really?

03:39.750 --> 03:41.030
Masaki.

03:41.030 --> 03:44.750
You aren’t just trying to trick me
into working with your research?

03:46.350 --> 03:47.480
I dunno.

03:47.480 --> 03:48.240
Bye.

03:51.040 --> 03:53.780
Germany...

03:53.780 --> 03:57.550
If I go, I won’t be able to return for a while.

03:57.550 --> 03:59.730
And in Germany...

04:00.820 --> 04:04.720
That’s right, Johan is in Germany.

04:05.760 --> 04:07.250
But...

04:07.250 --> 04:11.560
Ayako-san! We promised, didn’t we?

04:11.560 --> 04:16.020
That when you go to Germany, I’d go with you.

04:21.720 --> 04:29.460
Celebrate!
Embrace

04:22.370 --> 04:24.040
Thank you, Mamoru!

04:25.750 --> 04:28.240
I-I-I-I’m sorry!

04:28.240 --> 04:29.460
No, um...

04:29.460 --> 04:32.270
Stare...

04:32.270 --> 04:33.330
Wh-What?

04:33.330 --> 04:35.920
Nothing. Just, if you go to Germany,

04:35.920 --> 04:39.650
we won’t be able to see you two
love birds for a while...

04:39.650 --> 04:41.660
Keep at it. Don’t worry about us.

04:41.660 --> 04:43.810
We’ll just stand here and watch.

04:43.810 --> 04:45.510
Why, you...

04:49.350 --> 04:51.070
Ayako-san?

04:51.070 --> 04:54.580
If I just tell them I want to go to Germany with their son,

04:54.580 --> 04:56.940
won’t they think I’m some kind of hussy?

04:56.940 --> 04:59.770
I should have brought candy as a present or something...

04:59.770 --> 05:00.730
Aw...

05:00.730 --> 05:02.260
Miss...

05:04.460 --> 05:06.830
I thought this might happen, so...

05:08.530 --> 05:10.700
P-Pickled konbu?

05:10.700 --> 05:13.660
Lots of minerals, and it’s good for blood flow!

05:13.660 --> 05:16.380
I think I had some jam donuts, too...

05:19.790 --> 05:22.710
See you soon!

05:23.760 --> 05:25.690
Germany! How wonderful!

05:25.690 --> 05:27.460
Bring back presents!

05:27.460 --> 05:30.440
I want a pennant with the Rhine River on it!

05:30.440 --> 05:33.100
Why not a sausage doll for you, Itsumi?

05:33.100 --> 05:36.980
Oh maybe that, you know, that!

05:36.980 --> 05:38.230
Why...

05:39.160 --> 05:42.040
Why do the two of you have to go to Germany?

05:42.040 --> 05:44.700
I just explained this.

05:44.700 --> 05:46.400
Ayako-san’s beatrice ability...

05:46.400 --> 05:48.990
But why do you have to go, too?!

05:49.950 --> 05:52.860
There’s that Johan guy in Germany, right?

05:52.860 --> 05:55.290
You might be in danger again...

05:55.290 --> 05:56.980
Oh, my. Is that right?

05:56.980 --> 05:58.220
I’m fine.

05:58.220 --> 06:01.250
I’ve kept up my Beatrice Control practice.

06:01.250 --> 06:06.530
Yes, and I’ll take responsibility
for keeping your son safe...

06:07.200 --> 06:08.550
I don’t get it.

06:09.590 --> 06:14.680
All kinds of people are after you
because of your beatrice power, right?

06:14.680 --> 06:16.030
Y-Yeah.

06:16.030 --> 06:19.190
Then protecting him shouldn’t even be a consideration!

06:19.630 --> 06:21.610
If you truly love him,

06:21.610 --> 06:23.630
if you really want to protect him,

06:23.630 --> 06:26.550
you shouldn’t even need your beatrice power!

06:28.070 --> 06:29.040
Itsumi!

06:29.040 --> 06:30.980
Itsu-chan...

06:32.240 --> 06:33.820
I-I can’t...

06:33.820 --> 06:35.000
I’ll be going now.

06:35.000 --> 06:36.210
Ayako-san!

06:41.580 --> 06:42.630
Ayako-san!

06:43.930 --> 06:44.920
Miss?

06:45.350 --> 06:47.960
Itsumi-san may be right.

06:48.820 --> 06:54.140
If I really care about you,
I should welcome losing this power.

06:54.140 --> 06:55.930
That’s not true!

06:56.260 --> 07:00.520
I can’t say that I haven’t been in danger
because of your beatrice.

07:00.520 --> 07:06.360
But thanks to that, I’ve gotten much closer to you.

07:06.360 --> 07:10.280
I’ve always been able to feel connected to you.

07:10.960 --> 07:11.870
So...

07:14.530 --> 07:15.630
Thank you.

07:15.630 --> 07:16.670
Then...

07:16.670 --> 07:18.950
But I won’t go.

07:19.640 --> 07:24.440
I can do this without going to Germany,
without relying on Masaki.

07:25.050 --> 07:27.810
The beatrice chose me.

07:27.810 --> 07:31.380
So I can keep it with me, I know it. Right?

07:31.820 --> 07:33.000
Ayako-san...

07:43.660 --> 07:47.850
<i>Ayako-san turned down Masaki-san’s offer.</i>

07:49.650 --> 07:56.590
Meeting

07:49.900 --> 07:52.350
<i>The days are passing by.</i>

07:52.950 --> 07:56.590
<i>She’s getting worse and worse.</i>

07:57.350 --> 07:59.910
<i>But she says it’s OK.</i>

08:00.350 --> 08:04.150
<i>No matter what I ask, all she says is,
“You don’t need to worry, Mamoru.”</i>

08:06.420 --> 08:08.730
Ayako-san’s hiding it, I know it.

08:12.340 --> 08:13.830
At this rate...

08:13.830 --> 08:18.250
It’s not looking good, is it?

08:18.250 --> 08:19.720
Emelenzia...

08:19.720 --> 08:23.140
We haven’t spoken since Valentine’s, have we?

08:26.940 --> 08:31.520
With the Horacle problem, everyone got dust...

08:32.460 --> 08:37.740
dashed... distracted, but...

08:37.740 --> 08:38.830
Yes.

08:38.830 --> 08:40.650
Don’t worry.

08:40.650 --> 08:44.250
I’m going to leave it that way for a while.

08:44.740 --> 08:48.910
Yoshimura Mamoru, I haven’t given up on you.

08:48.910 --> 08:52.760
But I need to take you, fair and square,

08:52.760 --> 08:56.490
from the Witch Beatrice at the height of her powers, or there’s no point.

08:56.490 --> 08:58.200
Emelenzia...

08:58.200 --> 09:01.490
Please, Mamoru, take care of Witch Beatrice...

09:03.140 --> 09:04.600
Vice-President!

09:04.600 --> 09:08.310
M-Mamoru-san, Ayako... Ayako collapsed!

09:10.800 --> 09:11.810
Ayako-san!

09:12.440 --> 09:13.450
Mamoru-kun...

09:15.740 --> 09:17.770
Are you OK?

09:19.030 --> 09:21.160
Yes, I’m just fine.

09:21.800 --> 09:25.540
Shione, I told you not to make a big deal out of this...

09:25.540 --> 09:26.660
But...

09:26.660 --> 09:30.650
The Horacle is just kind of
taking away my beatrice control...

09:30.650 --> 09:33.840
If I concentrate...

09:33.840 --> 09:37.550
Still, you should go home early, just in case.

09:37.550 --> 09:40.440
I’ve contacted Kikukawa-san.

09:40.440 --> 09:42.100
I’ll go with you.

09:42.100 --> 09:43.290
No, don’t.

09:43.290 --> 09:44.060
But...

09:44.650 --> 09:48.060
You’ve got Beatrice Control class next, right?

09:48.060 --> 09:50.190
You’re not good at that, so...

09:52.850 --> 09:54.650
Ayako-san...

10:07.080 --> 10:08.460
Mamoru-san?

10:08.460 --> 10:11.910
Fifth period’s about to start.

10:11.910 --> 10:12.920
Right.

10:20.320 --> 10:21.220
I wonder why.

10:22.710 --> 10:26.060
Why did she refuse to go to Germany?

10:26.060 --> 10:28.220
W-Well...

10:28.760 --> 10:31.570
In her fight with Johan a year ago,

10:31.570 --> 10:36.630
I learned that I didn’t have the
right to stand by her side.

10:36.630 --> 10:38.060
But...

10:38.060 --> 10:42.040
Mamoru-kun, if you can’t protect her...

10:44.850 --> 10:49.360
No, please, Mamoru-kun... Save her.

10:49.360 --> 10:52.180
You’re the only one who can.

11:01.970 --> 11:04.080
<i>The only one who can save Ayako-san...</i>

11:04.900 --> 11:06.100
Mamoru,

11:06.700 --> 11:08.150
let’s go, now.

11:08.150 --> 11:10.940
Yeah, that’s right. Class...

11:11.480 --> 11:13.940
<i>Please, Mamoru, take care of Witch Beatrice...</i>

11:17.210 --> 11:18.390
Yeah.

11:28.550 --> 11:29.910
Ayako-san...

11:29.910 --> 11:32.790
You’re so frail...

11:33.570 --> 11:36.120
Your cherry-blossom lips gone pale...

11:37.880 --> 11:45.030
And it’s all because of that useless fool Mamoru that your beatrice was sealed...

11:45.030 --> 11:47.070
Wait, you sealed it, didn’t you?

11:47.070 --> 11:52.210
Yes. I can’t live without you, Ayako-san!

11:52.940 --> 11:54.400
M-Mary!

11:54.400 --> 11:55.930
Hey, Mr. Tsune!

11:55.930 --> 11:58.280
Skipping school to obsess over Witch Beatrice?

11:59.280 --> 12:01.680
I-I’m so sorry...

12:02.240 --> 12:04.680
You always screw things up at the end.

12:04.680 --> 12:07.160
You were so close.

12:07.730 --> 12:10.800
You sealed her beatrice power with the Horacle.

12:10.800 --> 12:13.540
That was your chance!

12:13.890 --> 12:15.670
Chance?

12:16.710 --> 12:17.910
Listen.

12:17.910 --> 12:23.800
Women always want to be overpowered by a strong man.

12:24.140 --> 12:27.090
O-Overpowered by a strong man...

12:27.090 --> 12:29.100
The scales have fallen from my eyes!

12:29.100 --> 12:31.250
The drool from my ears!

12:31.250 --> 12:32.650
The big toe from my socks!

12:32.650 --> 12:35.120
Just wait, Ayako-san!

12:35.120 --> 12:39.490
I’m on my way to overpower you!

12:42.030 --> 12:44.320
You’re so simple, Mr. Tsune.

12:46.160 --> 12:47.700
This is it, right?

12:51.120 --> 12:53.280
<i>It’s not Ayako-san’s fault at all.</i>

12:53.280 --> 12:54.640
<i>I know that.</i>

12:54.640 --> 12:55.940
<i>But...</i>

12:57.950 --> 12:59.910
I’m going home...

13:04.430 --> 13:06.940
Um, what are you doing?

13:06.940 --> 13:09.180
Can’t you tell?

13:09.180 --> 13:11.960
Waiting for Ayako-san to fall into this trap...

13:12.720 --> 13:15.810
You’re Yoshimura Mamoru’s stupid sister!

13:15.270 --> 13:17.890
Stupid -> Sister -> Stupid Sister

13:17.890 --> 13:19.860
S-Stupid sister?!

13:19.860 --> 13:22.610
Wait, how do you know me?

13:22.610 --> 13:24.410
Well, you know...

13:25.470 --> 13:26.570
Someone shady...

13:26.570 --> 13:27.990
You mean you’re shady?

13:28.780 --> 13:29.940
Shut up!

13:29.940 --> 13:32.210
Look at that!

13:37.250 --> 13:39.460
They know that Ayako-san’s weakened!

13:39.460 --> 13:42.150
So they’re trying to overpower her, too...

13:43.080 --> 13:45.570
So, stupid sister.

13:45.570 --> 13:48.690
You need to do something for Ayako-san, as well.

13:56.030 --> 13:57.660
What is this place?

13:57.660 --> 14:01.400
This is my other house. I call it Base 2.

14:01.400 --> 14:04.860
To Ayako

14:01.400 --> 14:04.860
Then this house leads to Ayako-san’s house!

14:06.510 --> 14:08.780
A shrine?

14:08.780 --> 14:10.480
Fool.

14:10.480 --> 14:13.490
Don’t underestimate the Takasu family.

14:13.900 --> 14:15.660
The first layer is adamantine.

14:15.660 --> 14:16.690
Then platinum.

14:16.690 --> 14:17.870
Then gold-silver-pearl.

14:18.460 --> 14:24.000
It’s blocked out off by many strong walls.
It’s not that easy to get into.

14:24.000 --> 14:25.340
Excuse me, question!

14:25.340 --> 14:26.430
Yes, stupid sister?

14:26.430 --> 14:30.300
So why’d you make a base here?

14:32.600 --> 14:36.890
Well, you know, so I can listen to
her footsteps, as she walks past,

14:36.890 --> 14:42.610
or feel the warmth on my skin, from this wall that I know comes from her bedroom,

14:42.610 --> 14:46.490
or rehearse for when the time comes...

14:46.490 --> 14:47.400
Creepy!

14:49.620 --> 14:51.740
What does a stupid sister know?

14:51.740 --> 14:55.060
It’s all for my pure love of Ayako-san!

14:55.060 --> 14:58.410
And for that, you need to strip right here!

14:59.790 --> 15:04.180
Come on, come on, come on...

15:04.180 --> 15:06.880
Strip!

15:04.180 --> 15:06.880
No!

15:15.210 --> 15:16.370
An intruder?

15:16.370 --> 15:20.910
Looks like someone disarmed the
anti-intruder beatrice devices.

15:21.720 --> 15:23.880
You stay here and rest.

15:23.880 --> 15:26.050
The house’s defenses are perfect.

15:26.050 --> 15:26.820
But...

15:31.770 --> 15:32.530
Kikukawa?

15:32.530 --> 15:34.410
It’s nothing.

15:34.410 --> 15:36.700
I’ll go reheat this tea.

15:46.060 --> 15:49.210
Why do I have to wear this?

15:50.330 --> 15:52.280
Look at that.

15:57.550 --> 15:58.970
Ayako-san’s room!

15:58.970 --> 16:01.070
At this rate, she’ll be in danger!

16:01.070 --> 16:03.000
Now, stupid sister, go!

16:03.000 --> 16:04.450
Wh-Why me?

16:05.230 --> 16:07.830
Stop babbling!

16:07.830 --> 16:13.700
Even with your underdeveloped body,
if you go try and seduce him, he’ll...

16:15.620 --> 16:17.540
Looks like he noticed.

16:19.450 --> 16:21.200
Impressive, my foe!

16:21.200 --> 16:23.640
Of course he’d notice, with you screaming that loudly!

16:33.090 --> 16:36.620
Hey... Don’t pretend to be dead.

16:38.510 --> 16:41.330
Idiot Moron Dummy

16:41.330 --> 16:42.580
What?

16:42.580 --> 16:45.080
You’re saying that I’m a strong enough
opponent to be real threat?

16:45.080 --> 16:46.170
Fool!

16:46.170 --> 16:49.000
Now you’ve gotten me angry!

16:49.000 --> 16:52.030
These glasses were given to me by the Silver Maria.

16:52.030 --> 16:56.210
My secret beatrice power is so dangerous

16:56.210 --> 16:59.140
that even she feared it and sealed it away.

16:59.140 --> 17:01.880
And now, it’s time for me to release it.

17:06.030 --> 17:08.520
Take this!

17:10.740 --> 17:12.090
I-Impossible!

17:12.090 --> 17:13.950
What was that light?

17:13.950 --> 17:19.330
Girls I look at are drained of strength
and fall to their knees...

17:17.300 --> 17:21.720
I’m very sorry

17:19.330 --> 17:21.900
It’s my ultimate technique!

17:21.900 --> 17:23.390
I don’t really understand,

17:23.390 --> 17:27.070
but that’s not a beatrice power.
That’s just looking at someone.

17:27.890 --> 17:30.040
And those are men, to begin with.

17:30.650 --> 17:32.040
Kikukawa-san!

17:32.040 --> 17:33.580
I’ll go with you!

17:37.280 --> 17:38.660
Itsumi-san!

17:40.820 --> 17:42.210
Ayako-san!

17:49.550 --> 17:49.960
Miss!

17:52.560 --> 17:53.400
Ayako-san!

17:53.880 --> 17:54.640
Are you OK?

17:54.640 --> 17:55.640
Ayako-san?

17:55.640 --> 17:56.640
This way, Itsumi-san.

18:04.200 --> 18:05.160
Miss!

18:05.160 --> 18:06.960
Are you OK, Itsumi-san?

18:06.960 --> 18:08.290
Yes.

18:08.290 --> 18:13.030
I will never forgive you for getting
mud on Ayako-san’s holy body!

18:13.030 --> 18:14.610
I told you it’s not going to work!

18:15.530 --> 18:18.320
This is meaningless.

18:20.220 --> 18:23.910
Have you learned the true power
of my beatrice secret technique?

18:26.510 --> 18:27.860
I see.

18:27.860 --> 18:29.840
This is a pistil.

18:29.840 --> 18:32.210
I guess it does work on anything female.

18:32.210 --> 18:35.140
Even after I put my glasses on, it’s not working!

18:36.420 --> 18:39.370
Petals spinning fast!

18:43.330 --> 18:45.290
Miss, please run.

18:45.290 --> 18:47.560
OK, I’m leaving this to you, Kikukawa.

18:47.560 --> 18:48.640
Come, Itsumi-san.

18:55.900 --> 18:56.900
What?

18:58.200 --> 18:59.130
Draw!

19:10.720 --> 19:13.840
<i>What a tiny hand...</i>

19:13.840 --> 19:18.590
<i>Without her beatrice, she’s just a girl like me.</i>

19:18.590 --> 19:22.220
<i>But... But I...</i>

19:31.510 --> 19:32.900
When did he...

19:33.250 --> 19:34.980
Itsumi-san, run!

19:44.640 --> 19:45.710
Ayako-san!

19:49.870 --> 19:51.080
Mamoru!

19:51.080 --> 19:52.790
Are you OK, Ayako-san?

19:52.790 --> 19:53.900
Itsumi?

19:53.900 --> 19:54.990
Why are you dressed like that?

19:54.990 --> 19:57.460
Um, well...

20:00.040 --> 20:01.660
Emelenzia!

20:01.660 --> 20:02.860
Leave it to me.

20:19.730 --> 20:21.580
Itsumi-san, are you hurt?

20:22.470 --> 20:23.420
I’m fine.

20:23.900 --> 20:27.320
Jeez... What were thinking coming to Ayako-san’s house?

20:27.320 --> 20:28.610
But I’m glad.

20:28.610 --> 20:29.690
You saved me.

20:29.690 --> 20:32.100
Thank you, Mamoru. Emelenzia.

20:32.100 --> 20:34.760
You’re wec... welc... welcome.

20:35.200 --> 20:36.630
Um...

20:38.750 --> 20:41.230
Thank you, Ayako-san.

20:42.690 --> 20:45.570
I was a little jealous.

20:46.200 --> 20:48.940
I can’t use beatrice.

20:48.940 --> 20:51.480
But you and Mamoru...

20:53.000 --> 20:55.220
I felt a bit lonely.

20:55.220 --> 20:59.090
I felt like you were connected on
a level I couldn’t understand...

20:59.090 --> 21:04.060
But even without using beatrice, you protected me.

21:05.210 --> 21:06.550
Itsumi-san...

21:07.650 --> 21:10.070
Mamoru, go to Germany.

21:10.070 --> 21:10.730
Itsumi...

21:10.730 --> 21:13.330
And protect Ayako-san!

21:21.170 --> 21:22.500
Mamoru...

21:24.240 --> 21:28.280
Ayako-san, I want to be a flower, watching over you...

21:33.980 --> 21:37.060
Ayako, the beatrice is waiting for you.

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:14.940 --> 23:18.430
We’re at the tail end, and everyone’s had their turn.

23:18.430 --> 23:21.250
I think we should return where we began

23:21.250 --> 23:24.000
and do a simple preview, like the first time.

23:24.000 --> 23:28.450
All things return to their proper place, yes?

23:28.450 --> 23:30.080
Wonderful, Brother.

23:30.080 --> 23:32.790
Then, next time...

23:32.790 --> 23:36.380
Wait, the preview is already over!

23:37.050 --> 23:39.980
I have witnessed a miracle!

23:39.980 --> 23:42.740
Next time: Return to the Beginning.

23:40.480 --> 23:43.980
Return to the Beginning
